  "title": "Chef John's Baked Eggs",
  "description": "Chef John's baked eggs recipe features a spicy marinara sauce that mingles with just barely set eggs and tops them with cream and Parmigiano-Reggiano.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
