        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MHA-5W0XPSgIvP9CsXKugWngtAc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/1003203-f7f68632e6844ecc90f4d62c1d8c9b18.jpg"
      ],
